Z||000003||tgowens||02-09-2001||02:36 PM||||awwww Haze, now I gotta do a search for "upset" !!<P>KEV, welcome to the forum and please don't get "upset" about being looked over - I can't speak for anyone else here but I do know that I generally look over the forum at night (or when I have a break from work) and just simply cannot answer everyone - there are posts that I can answer quickly and those that are more lengthy in response - I do work with these cars all day every day (Fiero Shop) and know most but certainly not all of the answers.........there are quite a few people on here with in-depth knowledge of these little cars who can help........there are quite a few people on here who are just learning, there are quite a few who just love to have fun and there are quite a few who just love to.........well, like Haze for example...........(j/k Haze!)<P>All in all, Cliff has put together a great forum for us and please don't get discouraged by a lack of response - ask again or even email someone (you can find their email address by clicking on the little icon above their post) who you feel could help.........<P>OK Haze, carry on..............<P>------------------<BR>My Fiero Web Site.....<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tgowens.gif">    </A>||||reg||1
